# NOTE: github.com/mwabichils/ufmtwebsite is a PUBLIC repository. Everything
# committed here is world-readable and stays in the git history even if it is
# deleted later. The exclusions below are deliberate — read the reasons before
# removing any of them.
# =============================================================================

# --- Confidential. Must not be published ------------------------------------
# The compliance audit carries an explicit notice: "strictly confidential and
# may not be copied, reproduced, reverse-engineered, modified, or distributed
# to any third party, in whole or in part, without the express prior written
# consent of NorthLight Advisory." Pushing it to a public repo is distribution.
HPCSA Regulatory and Ethical Compliance Audit*.docx
audit-extract.txt

